# M15 "Avlaklar", flow "m15_slots" run tanyeri (StartZone = 0, EnterLevel = 20, MonsterAttack = 25: the
# server's testing hooks, docs/PROTOCOL_LEVELS.md §5): a new Aydor warrior enters Tanyeri at level 20 with
# 57 unspent points (left unspent: the stored level is raised only by the next save), walks out to the two new slot kinds of the Aydor homeland:
# Kavruk Ekin 1 (Kavruk Tırpancı, levels 5-7, north-west) and Harman Yeri 1 (Harman Devi, 8-10, the far
# south). At each: the slot's name line under the zone name (approach), the fight, the kill.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m15_tanyeri
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kavrukcu
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+zone2+statsknown 1800
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 600
expect world+level20+unspent57
# ---- Kavruk Ekin 1: Kavruk Tırpancı (5-7) ----
scene walkpath 111 383.1
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
waitfor world+monsters 600
expect world+slot+slot_tanyeri_kavruk_1
expecttext world.slotname Kavruk Ekin 1 · Sv. 5-7
scene walktomonster Kavruk Tırpancı 6
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 4
screenshot 01_kavruk_approach.png
scene target nearest Kavruk Tırpancı
key f
waitfor world+attacking+ownhits1 900
scene camera side 24 6
wait 6
screenshot 02_kavruk_fight.png
waitfor world+kills1 2400
expect world+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 28 6
wait 5
screenshot 03_kavruk_kill.png
# ---- Harman Yeri 1: Harman Devi (8-10) ----
key escape
scene walkpath 210.2 98.8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 4800
waitfor world+alive 600
expect world+slot+slot_tanyeri_harman_1
expecttext world.slotname Harman Yeri 1 · Sv. 8-10
scene walktomonster Harman Devi 6
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 4
screenshot 04_harman_approach.png
scene target nearest Harman Devi
key f
waitfor world+attacking+incombat 900
wait 30
scene camera side 26 7
wait 6
screenshot 05_harman_fight.png
waitfor world+kills2 3000
expect world+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 30 7
wait 5
screenshot 06_harman_kill.png
quit
